</tr>
<tr>
<td>6</td>
<td>1 month later</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<h2 id="the-leitner-box-no-app-needed">The Leitner box (no app needed)</h2>
<ol>
<li>Write each word on a card and put new cards in <strong>Box 1</strong>.</li>
<li>Review Box 1 daily, Box 2 every 3 days, Box 3 weekly.</li>
<li>Remember the word? Move the card <strong>up</strong> a box.</li>
<li>Forget it? It goes <strong>back to Box 1</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<blockquote class="callout callout-tip">
<p class="callout-title">Tip</p>
<p>Put the word in a sentence on the back of the card. Words learned in context stick far better than isolated translations.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Ten minutes a day of spaced review beats an hour of cramming once a week.</p>
